{"text":"MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "An Open Sky feels like a natural next choice because its explicitly soothing guitar and cello match the calm listening mood of my recent relaxing classical selection.",
    "Duets II fits my interest in polished vocal performances such as Stages and A Musical Affair, while Gentle on My Mind connects with the melodic country side of my listening."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Sunshine & Whiskey suggests a livelier country mood than I want now; my interest in country does not mean every country mood suits this session.",
    "The Walter Mitty soundtrack does not give me the same expectation of orchestral music as Downton Abbey, and the rock selections offer less reason to expect the calming instrumentals or polished vocals I want.",
    "The Greatest Hits gives me too little information about the artist or sound to feel confident choosing it."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My country listening seems to have been treated as a broad preference without enough attention to gentle melodies and the mood I want today.",
    "My interest in a particular television soundtrack seems to have been extended to other soundtracks without a clear connection in musical style."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My most recent choice of relaxing classical music makes an explicitly soothing sound especially appealing right now.",
    "The connection across my vocal selections is the expressive singing and polished arrangements; gentle harmonies appeal too, but duets and relaxation music would be my first choices today."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations partly understood my interest in melodic vocals and country, but gave too little weight to my current preference for calming music and specific musical qualities."
}"}
